{"seq":1,"slug":"scientific-works","title":"科学著作","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/major-works/scientific-works","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"qed-papers-and-theory-of-fundamental-processes","title":"量子电动力学论文","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/major-works/scientific-works/qed-papers-and-theory-of-fundamental-processes","wordCount":1885,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"qed-the-strange-theory-of-light-and-matter","title":"《QED：光与物质的奇异理论》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/major-works/scientific-works/qed-the-strange-theory-of-light-and-matter","wordCount":1447,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"科学著作\">科学著作</h1><p>本章回顾费曼的科学著作，从奠定其学术地位的专业论文，到面向普通读者讲解量子电动力学的经典小书。它们展现了费曼在最专业与最通俗两个层面上同样卓越的表达能力。</p>\n<p>第一篇文档介绍他在量子电动力学上的奠基性论文，及其对粒子物理的深远影响。第二篇文档介绍《QED：光与物质的奇异理论》——他如何用最浅白的语言，向毫无数学基础的大众讲清这门最精密的理论。</p>\n"}